      "html": "<h1>Generating and downloading reports</h1>\n<p>Reports are generated on demand, then downloaded once ready — every download is re-checked against what you&#39;re allowed to see.</p>\n<h2>Steps</h2>\n<ol><li>Open <strong>Reports</strong> from the sidebar.</li><li>Choose the <strong>report type</strong>, then fill in whatever it needs (class, section, or student).</li><li>Choose the <strong>format</strong> — PDF, Excel (.xlsx), or CSV. PDF is the printable version of a grade card or hall ticket; Excel and CSV contain its rows for analysis.</li><li>Click <strong>Generate report</strong>. Larger reports run in the background and appear as &quot;pending&quot; until they finish.</li><li>Click <strong>Refresh</strong> if a report you just generated hasn&#39;t appeared yet, then download it from the list.</li></ol>\n<blockquote class=\"help-screenshot\">Screenshot: the reports list with a completed report ready to download.</blockquote>"
